      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的……！\n能向日本赛跑界的夙愿发起挑战……\n我很荣幸……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "489b35d3fa899da075c470f842160086ddfae7fa2c82b345413b1fac0b0c66a9",
