    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c782705e28902d0a5e38d427",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和小爱的『育马者杯』一起……\n希望能共同达成史上最初……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4be3b2fb72b66e57577ff702e5341a6a1ace6de50be5695ceea93cdfa9dd36ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4573322cfbaaefe0599284f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "创世驹和同期们就像约定的那样，\n在各自的道路上达成了极致。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fad0fa9c2e3745613c30d0f55df77c1d4e7e812f9e8fa5b828caa794ac2837ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d3fa4af8d04a3f2f961036",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯独爱你在香港国际GⅠ取得了胜利。\n这个秋天，她将去挑战日本赛跑界的夙愿\n——『育马者杯』",
      "source_fingerprint": "c19197c4af74b4473a68d3bf8879e45ccbd54d23a6b2b1fd68c28f7035b9fff3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:971dfa5e770f844a5ab4019f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "放声欢呼获得英短双距离制霸后，\n也正以三距离制霸为目标\n向中距离发起挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab4f601ed2659382b813b1c85ab24ee17b7e16ffbcc28f004f1894cdf6a6c13d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e60a9f304d9df2d7a3f2cf73",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花在被认为对于后冠马娘来说\n很严苛的『天皇赏（春）』中展现了\n惊人的毅力，令粉丝为之沸腾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d24aab9b9449cb964cb4e3c9d2735a14562c2370b01306e34180fad1aa0b19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1754439b5a914193b1e38ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，创世驹则是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "243eda12d98b070b895ed7ede95da07441a8e198733e946183a8df551286fe21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:770ae4be8ee52dd3ff3853aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在春季『宝冢纪念』中获胜。\n达成了后冠赛马娘史上最初的\n大奖赛三连霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21cf4626c560a794b694c553560a2d0b1afe2b5d741945e40268424580d1c07f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b93f513333a41ab988c4378",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接下来的目标是『凯旋门赏』，\n以及赢下『有马纪念』后的\n大奖赛四连霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2ff8176d3693ff9c7864744996b516ad43bf1b847299e96d79971a0a4b97b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1133/storytimeline_501133111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
